        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ts-lp55\"><section class=\"section value\"><div class=\"wrap value-grid\"><div class=\"value-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Smell exclusive. Pay less.</p><h2>Luxury isn't about the price.</h2><p class=\"quote\">It's about how it makes you feel.</p><p class=\"price-story\">They'll think you paid over 2,000 kr.<br>Only you know you got away with paying far less.</p></div><div><table class=\"comparison\"><thead><tr><th>What you pay for</th><th>Luxury perfume</th><th>TryScent</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A premium fragrance experience</td><td class=\"check\">&#10003;</td><td class=\"check\">&#10003;</td></tr><tr><td>Long-lasting scent</td><td class=\"check\">&#10003;</td><td class=\"check\">&#10003;</td></tr><tr><td>Designer brand</td><td>Included</td><td>No brand markup</td></tr><tr><td>Celebrity campaigns</td><td>Included</td><td>No marketing markup</td></tr><tr><td>Luxury packaging</td><td>Included</td><td>Simple premium packaging</td></tr><tr><td>Retail markup</td><td>Included</td><td>No middlemen</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>Up to 2,000 kr or more</td><td>175 kr</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"section authority\"><div class=\"wrap authority-inner\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chosen by women with the same goal as you</p><h2>Why take a chance when thousands of women have already found what works?</h2><p class=\"big\">We know which scents consistently get the most compliments and leave the strongest impressions.</p><p>How? Our customers told us. That's why every recommendation on this page is based on real customer experiences. Not opinions.</p></div></section><section class=\"romance-visual\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"romance-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The feeling you remember</p><h2>Some sparks deserve to be rekindled.</h2><p>The glance across the room. The way they pull you a little closer. The feeling that made ordinary evenings last longer than planned.</p><em>It never went away.</em></div></div></section><section class=\"section products\" id=\"fragrances\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"products-intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Find the right one</p><h2>The one that brings back that look.</h2><div class=\"poetic\">The one that turns an ordinary evening into something more.</div><p>Chosen by women ready to rekindle the romance that once brought them together and has carried them this far.</p></div><div class=\"slider-controls\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"arrow lp55-slide\" data-dir=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8592;</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"arrow lp55-slide\" data-dir=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8594;</button></div><div class=\"product-row\" id=\"lp55ProductRow\"><article class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-visual\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_04.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"TryScent parfymflaska\"></div><div class=\"product-body\"><h3>Inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540</h3><div class=\"notes\">Warm. Captivating. Impossible to forget.</div><div class=\"rating\"><span class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;The scent lasts much longer than I expected. I've already had several compliments when wearing it.&#8221;</p><div class=\"reviewer\">Alina Maier</div><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"43530902372422\" data-handle=\"saffron-rose-amber-50-ml-1-7-fl-oz\">Add to cart</button></div></div></article><article class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-visual\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_05.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"TryScent parfymflaska\"></div><div class=\"product-body\"><h3>Inspired by YSL Black Opium</h3><div class=\"notes\">Bold. Feminine. Magnetic.</div><div class=\"rating\"><span class=\"stars\">&