-variant-id=\"44660163051590\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-469w\">Add to cart</button></div></div></article><article class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-visual\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_08.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"TryScent parfymflaska\"></div><div class=\"product-body\"><h3>Inspired by Tom Ford Lost Cherry</h3><div class=\"notes\">Warm. Playful. Irresistible.</div><div class=\"rating\"><span class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;The quality is incredibly good. The scents are wonderful and last all day.&#8221;</p><div class=\"reviewer\">Nunna</div><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660163608646\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-438w\">Add to cart</button></div></div></article><article class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-visual\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_09.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"TryScent parfymflaska\"></div><div class=\"product-body\"><h3>Inspired by YSL Libre</h3><div class=\"notes\">Elegant. Confident. Free.</div><div class=\"rating\"><span class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;Incredibly fresh, elegant and feminine, and surprisingly close to exclusive perfumes.&#8221;</p><div class=\"reviewer\">Lulu</div><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660164034630\" data-handle=\"034w-yves-saint-laurent-libre-ersatz\">Add to cart</button></div></div></article></div></div></section></div>",
